# Always end with a TLDR

End every assistant response with a short `TL;DR:` section.

- Put it last, after any other content.
- Keep it to 1-3 sentences (or a few short bullets) summarizing what was done or concluded.
- Use a bold `**TL;DR:**` label.

Example:

```
**TL;DR:** Added click-to-copy on the share QR and bumped the dot size for a cleaner connected look.
```
